   "frameId": null,
   "text": "I looked through the last two weeks of your\ninbox and Slack. A few threads might need\nattention. Lena asked about the keynote slot\non Tuesday and it doesn't look like you've\nreplied. Priya mentioned the floor plan you\nsaid you'd send. Sam asked in #events about\nthe sponsor deck. I skipped newsletters,\nreceipts and invites. One thread from Wise\nand Sons may be waiting on them, not you.",
   "originalText": "I looked through the last two weeks of your\ninbox and Slack. A few threads might need\nattention. Lena asked about the keynote slot\non Tuesday and it doesn't look like you've\nreplied. Priya mentioned the floor plan you\nsaid you'd send. Sam asked in #events about\nthe sponsor deck. I skipped newsletters,\nreceipts and invites. One thread from Wise\nand Sons may be waiting on them, not you.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
